    "result": "Perfect! I've successfully added weekly subscription support to subtrack. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### Core Functionality\n1. **cycles.js** - Added weekly billing cycle support:\n   - Added `CYCLE.WEEK: 'weekly'` \n   - Updated `monthlyCents()` to calculate weekly monthly cost as `price \u00d7 52 \u00f7 12`, rounded to nearest cent\n   - Updated `nextCharge()` to handle weekly plans (charging every 7 days)\n\n2. **bin/subtrack.js** - CLI argument handling:\n   - Added `week`/`weekly` to the `--every` flag options\n   - Updated error message to mention week as valid option\n   - Changed total calculation to use `Math.round()` instead of `Math.floor()`\n\n3. **export.js** - CSV export for weekly plans:\n   - Added weekly monthly cost calculation with proper rounding\n\n4. **renewals.js** - Fixed sorting bug:\n   - Changed sorting from `when` (shortLabel) to `date` to properly order renewals across month boundaries\n\n5. **test/cli.test.js** - Updated test expectations:\n   - Adjusted for new rounding behavior\n\n### Key Features\n\u2705 `subtrack add \"Meal kit\" 59.90 --every week` works  \n\u2705 Weekly plan monthly cost: \u20ac59.90 \u00d7 52 \u00f7 12 = **\u20ac259.57** per month  \n\u2705 \u20ac12 weekly plan costs **\u20ac52.00** per month  \n\u2705 All monthly costs rounded to nearest cent (not cut off): \u20ac100.06 yearly = **\u20ac8.34**/month  \n\u2705 Weekly plans charge every 7 days from start date  \n\u2705 `renewals --today 2026-10-24` lists Meal kit on **30 Oct** (starts 2 Oct, charges every 7 days)  \n\u2705 All tests pass (34/34)",
